OL,3,GNEWSANo-confidence vote in councillors
OL,4,Awho allowed rapist to keep taxi
OL,5,Alicences
OL,6,
OL,7,FHighland councillors have
OL,8,Foverwhelmingly delivered a vote of no
OL,9,Fconfidence in five councillors who
OL,10,Fallowed a taxi driver convicted of rape
OL,11,Fto keep two taxi operator licences.
OL,13,FDavid Brown was jailed for almost seven
OL,14,Fyears in May after carrying out an
OL,15,Fattack on an 18-year-old passenger in a
OL,16,FRoss-shire lay-by in December 2023.
OL,18,FA month later, six male members of
OL,19,FHighland licensing committee voted to
OL,20,Ftake no action on licences held in
OL,21,FBrown's name, while four female
OL,22,Fcouncillors voted against the move.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
