OL,3,GNEWSANo-confidence vote in councillors
OL,4,Awho allowed rapist to keep taxi
OL,5,Alicences
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing a backlash, Brown surrendered
OL,8,Fhis licences. The vote of no confidence
OL,9,Frelated to Sean Kennedy, Chris Birt,
OL,10,FJohn Grafton, Ruraidh Stewart and
OL,11,FDuncan Macpherson.
